❗️🇺🇦 During February 2026, the air defense of the Defense Forces destroyed more than 30,000 air targets:

▪️ 3 Kh-47 M2 Kinzhal missiles;
▪️ 10 Kalibr cruise missiles;
▪️ 87 Kh-101 cruise missiles;
▪️ 7 Kh-22/Kh-32 cruise missiles;
▪️ 12 Iskander-K cruise missiles
▪️ 35 Iskander-M/KN-23 ballistic missiles;
